{title: Always Beautiful}
{artist: Ben & Robin Pasley}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[A2]You oh God [A2/G#]have eyes to see,[A2/F#] what others hide in [D]shame
[A2]You oh God [A2/G#]have ears to hear,[A2/F#] what broken people [D]pray

{comment: Bridge}
And you [A2]call [A2/G#]them back to your hand and you [A2/F#]call me [D]again (x2)

{comment: Chorus}
Where can I [A2]run, where can I [E]go, where can I [D2]hide myself
From your [C2]always [D2/B]beautiful    [A2]
Where can I [E]run, where can I [D2]go, where can I hide myself
From your [C2]never ending [D2/B]love

{comment: Verse 2}
[A2]You oh God [A2/G#]have a heart to feel,[A2/F#] when others turn [D]away
[A2]You oh God [A2/G#]have arms to hold,[A2/F#] the hurting one in [D]pain
